Z||000013||Voytek||11-02-2001||02:09 PM||||Wow.  It took me about half an hour to read it but there were some good arguments made.  Most of the good ones were made by the, shall we say 'clear-headed' people.<P>BTW, the word 'judgemental' has a negative connotation to it.  Anytime you don't like someone else's opinion, you may call them 'judgemental' and you look like the good, open-minded dude.<P>No, J - I don't think you were 'judgemental'.<P>Oh, almost forgot - Funguy seemed too passive to be the Non-Fun-Guy.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>EDITED: I just realized that some people smoke up to 'clear their heads' - that's NOT what I meant.<p>[This message has been edited by Voytek (edited 11-02-2001).]||||reg||1
